  <name>Permafrost</name>
  <summary>Block distractions until the timer runs out</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Permafrost blocks distracting websites and apps for as long as you choose.
      Lock a freeze and it can’t be stopped early, even by restarting your computer.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Block websites and apps with filters for social media, video, news, shopping, food delivery, games, gambling, adult content and harmful sites, or make your own</li>
      <li>Add community lists with hundreds of thousands of sites</li>
      <li>Freeze for 25 minutes or a whole day, or in Pomodoro rounds, or block on a schedule</li>
      <li>Allow only the websites and apps you need and block everything else</li>
      <li>Give filters a daily limit, like 30 minutes of YouTube a day</li>
      <li>Locked filters can only get stricter until the timer ends</li>
      <li>Force SafeSearch on Google, Bing, DuckDuckGo and YouTube</li>
      <li>See your focus time and streak in History</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
